{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有：X虽然更容易抓住关键情绪，但部分心理因果被压缩得太快，尤其是暖意为什么消散、他为什么逐渐不再动摇，Y交代得更清楚。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的主句短、关键词突出，感受又随音乐分时出现，观众不必一次读完大量文字，就能抓住每段的情绪变化；那些身体反应、声音画面和短暂的心理反复，也让感受更具体。Y的长句在短屏尤其难兼顾音乐和阅读，但它把怀念、害怕孤单、不愿再受委屈之间的因果讲得更明白，人物从犹豫到决定继续往前的过程也更连贯。综合实际观看体验，我选X，但Y在理解人物为什么这样和整条心理线索上确实更好。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a96480ae-10ab-4857-b5c4-85fdc42e9a35", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T060413999038Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:05:07.694982+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "afbbfa301e84317901afa66c0df63223eca4126d4e7998f075ff0d0eae2ab560", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c15